--- !u!114 &18346723
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 18346722}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9a8a903a70e47af4eaf9297a7a556806, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  NPCInteractionType: 0
  characterName: 
  choiceDialogue:
  - _speakingCharacter: 
    _dialogueText: Hello <NAME>! I am here to test your knowledge!
    _speakingSFX: {fileID: 0}
    choiceOptions: []
    NonImpactingChoice: 0
  - _speakingCharacter: 
    _dialogueText: For a tutorial, I will be quite lenient with you, but as you progress,
      the questions will get a lot harder!
    _speakingSFX: {fileID: 0}
    choiceOptions: []
    NonImpactingChoice: 0
  - _speakingCharacter: 
    _dialogueText: So, for my question, what is a "polynomial"?
    _speakingSFX: {fileID: 0}
    choiceOptions:
    - <ChoiceText>k__BackingField: An expression containing variables and coefficients.
      <CorrectAnswer>k__BackingField: 1
      <ResultingDialogue>k__BackingField:
      - _speakingCharacter: 
        _dialogueText: Bingo! A polynomial is a mathematical expression made up of
          terms that are combined using mathematical operands!
        _speakingSFX: {fileID: 0}
      - _speakingCharacter: 
        _dialogueText: Each term consists of a variable (like x or y) raised to a
          non-negative integer power, multiplied by a coefficient (a number).
        _speakingSFX: {fileID: 0}
    - <ChoiceText>k__BackingField: 'A sequence of numbers that are in order '
      <CorrectAnswer>k__BackingField: 0
      <ResultingDialogue>k__BackingField:
      - _speakingCharacter: 
        _dialogueText: I am sorry, that wasn't quite the right answer. Please try
          again.
        _speakingSFX: {fileID: 0}
    - <ChoiceText>k__BackingField: A graph plotting a list of numbers.
      <CorrectAnswer>k__BackingField: 0
      <ResultingDialogue>k__BackingField:
      - _speakingCharacter: 
        _dialogueText: Not exactly, that wasn't quite the right answer. Please try
          again.
        _speakingSFX: {fileID: 0}
    NonImpactingChoice: 0
  interactedWithOnce: 0
  saveQuestionToDisk: 0
  savableChoice:
    <ChoiceID>k__BackingField: 
    <SelectedChoice>k__BackingField: 0
    <TimeTakenToSelect>k__BackingField: 0
    <CorrectAnswer>k__BackingField: 0
  resultantDialogueObjects:
  - _speakingCharacter: 
    _dialogueText: You are all good to proceed now! Best of luck with your adventure!
    _speakingSFX: {fileID: 0}
